  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b><a id="cf" title="cf" href="#"></a>Stabilis Solutions, Inc. and Subsidiaries</b></p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;"><b>Condensed Consolidated Statements of Cash Flows</b></p>
  <p style="font-family:Times New Roman;font-size:10pt;font-variant:normal;text-align:center;margin:0pt;">(Unaudited, in thousands)</p>
